     A* Scandirect Bill File - Header
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 07/21/05 by c:79 for Project 129MJR
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will house the 'bill header' record for the
     A*          associated Scandir records.  Additional fields will be
     A*          added to the end of the file to hold information
     A*          specific to the matchup of the claim in Fiserv.It will
     A*          be tied to the FAW9P record via W1NAME.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PW101                     TEXT('Scandir Pmnt File - header')
     A            W1TYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Record Type')
